The conversion uses 1x1 convolution projections, activation scaling,
tanh-form SiLU and a split FFN. The language backbone and SigLIP2 vision tower
are exported as FP16 Core AI assets for the Apple Neural Engine. Tokenization,
image preprocessing, token-embedding lookup, the FP32 multimodal projector,
and option readout run on the host CPU. The model has not been retrained.
