Independent Core AI conversions of vllm-sr/d3-nano and vllm-sr/d3-mini,
fine-tuned from Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B and Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B, for text and image decisions.
Upstream: https://huggingface.co/vllm-sr/d3-nano, https://huggingface.co/vllm-sr/d3-mini
Revisions are pinned in src/tinkerbox_ane/d3/__init__.py and recorded in exported manifests.

Their checkpoints, upstream code and converted weights are governed by the
Apache License 2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). The language backbone runs as
FP16 Core AI stages and the vision tower as an FP16 Core AI asset on the Apple
Neural Engine; tokenization, image preprocessing, position tables,
token-embedding lookup and option readout run on the host CPU. The models
have not been retrained. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
vllm-sr or Qwen.
